WEBVTT

00:00:06.026 --> 00:00:08.022
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> How do people read today?

00:00:08.595 --> 00:00:12.099
Where do they read, and what kinds of things?

00:00:13.587 --> 00:00:16.916
People read many different things in their free time:

00:00:18.390 --> 00:00:18.994
books,

00:00:21.167 --> 00:00:22.160
newspapers,

00:00:24.922 --> 00:00:25.875
magazines,

00:00:28.735 --> 00:00:30.242
maybe subtitles.

00:00:33.234 --> 00:00:36.357
They read things when they’re studying, or at work:

00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:37.520
documents,

00:00:39.182 --> 00:00:39.915
websites,

00:00:41.613 --> 00:00:42.426
textbooks,

00:00:42.943 --> 00:00:43.983
or manuals.

00:00:46.389 --> 00:00:49.979
People read in different places and at different times:

00:00:51.205 --> 00:00:52.811
on the bus or train,

00:00:55.032 --> 00:00:55.800
in bed,

00:00:58.196 --> 00:00:59.557
or on vacation.

00:01:02.810 --> 00:01:05.920
Sometimes people read in another language:

00:01:07.219 --> 00:01:08.299
graded readers

00:01:11.363 --> 00:01:12.643
or song lyrics.

00:01:15.915 --> 00:01:18.472
People read in different ways today.

00:01:19.225 --> 00:01:23.786
They read on paper or on screen.

00:01:26.552 --> 00:01:31.155
People read all kinds of things in all kinds of places!

00:01:31.442 --> 00:01:32.590
What about you?